{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:460e25ebe2ecee1a","name":"Lorgrombo","source":{"id":"source:reference-460e25ebe2ecee1a","title":"Lorgrombo","revision":21369,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:40:24Z","sha256":"485204d21cd6cd983e91405663f943f6ed098060d97f5d24e8c14a1c0838a794","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21369","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lorgrombo&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-460e25ebe2ecee1a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Lugubraa Hordes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Lugubraa_Hordes","referenceId":"reference:520fd261973e5a3c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lorgrombo is more than 150 years old and possesses a piercing intellect that far outstrips those of his dull-minded peers. The elder ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lugubraa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lugubraa","referenceId":"reference:9da6a2b45ef5799a"}," works as a broker for his horde, booking hundreds of thousands of warriors for mercenary-minded clients or negotiating the employment of individual bodyguards for personal contracts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With more than a century of experience in his genius stage, Lorgrombo is one of the most well-connected beings in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". His deals have made him party to every major conflict currently burning across the galaxy's western disc, and he knows someone in every starport between Killik Space and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Ssi-Ruuvi Imperium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Ssi-Ruuvi_Imperium","referenceId":"reference:058ef1d43ba2b3b3"},". Many beings underestimate Lorgrombo, mistaking him for a typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lugubraa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lugubraa","referenceId":"reference:9da6a2b45ef5799a"},", but those in the know consider him the low-tech fringe equivalent of the great ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chiss","referenceId":"reference:bd57eaad77f8edcc"}," data library on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Csilla"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Csilla","referenceId":"reference:6948999d814dd418"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lorgrombo considers himself the great-great-grandfather of his horde, since most of them are the splitlings of his splitlings and beyond. He is keenly aware of planets where his horde has overrun the native lifeforms and run amok on continents or islands. After sadly concluding that such incidents are bad for business, he is enlisting adventurers to kill as many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lugubraa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lugubraa","referenceId":"reference:9da6a2b45ef5799a"}," as possible at such sites, but only after identifying and rescuing any specimens who have reached their 50-year intelligence threshold. Lorgrombo, who is looking to fill a lieutenant's vacancy, will pay a handsome reward for any intelligent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lugubraa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lugubraa","referenceId":"reference:9da6a2b45ef5799a"}," returned to his care.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Lorgrombo Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lugubraa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lugubraa","referenceId":"reference:9da6a2b45ef5799a"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 15/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"